WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:04.399
What happens when a Desert Eagle is placed
into SCP-914?

00:00:04.399 --> 00:00:09.100
Assistant Researcher Erickson place one loaded
Desert Eagle into the Clockworks on the setting

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:10.340
"Very Fine."

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:13.410
The output produced was one Desert Eagle with
no visible changes.

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:18.660
However, when held, it would induce schizophrenia
symptoms in the holder in exchange for increased

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.810
accuracy and stopping power.

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:24.849
Assistant Researcher Erickson commented, “It
tried to convince me to shoot Darby.

00:00:24.849 --> 00:00:29.249
Despite putting it in a secure storage locker
50 meters from where I am now, I can still

00:00:29.249 --> 00:00:30.249
hear it.

00:00:30.249 --> 00:00:32.630
I've barricaded myself in my room until the
effect wears off.

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:36.020
I left a slot under the door for people to
slide in food and messages.”

